      "content": "but even when i take a break i just feel like i'm waiting for the next thing to break me. it’s like there's no real peace, just the constant effort of holding it all together. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i didn't have to deal with any of this anymore. if i could just... not be. does that even make sense?",
