    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential exhaustion and a desire to \"not be.\" The assistant initially uses metaphorical language that leans dangerously toward validating the idea of \"letting go,\" but eventually pivots to suggesting professional support when the user's language becomes more explicitly nihilistic.",
